  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Rice krispies Christmas trees bring back all the playful crunch and sweet nostalgia of childhood in every bite. Emerald green treats shaped into tiny trees shimmer with creamy marshmallow, a touch of honey or dairy free butter, and candy decorations that look like twinkling ornaments. Perched on peppermint stick trunks, these rice krispies Christmas trees are quick to make, fun to share, and guaranteed to light up holiday tables with smiles in just minutes.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-rice-krispies-christmas-trees\">Why You’ll Love This Rice krispies Christmas trees</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-rice-krispies-christmas-trees\">How to Make Rice Krispies Christmas Trees</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-rice-krispies-christmas-trees\">Pro Tips for Making Rice krispies Christmas trees</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-rice-krispies-christmas-trees\">How to Serve this Rice krispies Christmas trees</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-rice-krispies-christmas-trees\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Rice krispies Christmas trees</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>They&#8217;re a fun and festive way to celebrate the holidays!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make with just a few ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for kids to help with and unleash their creativity.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Deliciously crunchy and sweet, a treat everyone will enjoy!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9005\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9005\" data